 "streaming": "As Mission 1, but the loops make the sections a graph, not a line: the courtyard (3) borders the restaurant, storage, the flats and the workshop. Loaded is the section you're in and every section it borders. The workshop's roof is walked in 5 but belongs to the workshop's building, so 6 loads with 5 as well. The alleys (7) are one section: their ring comes back to its own start. A border door holds until the section behind it is loaded, unloading waits until you're a few metres past a door, and a section remembers what's done. That memory matters more here: the courtyard and the alleys' first corner are each fought twice, and the second fight must not bring back the first one's dead.",
